Feature: Respond Questionnaires

Scenario: View unanswered questionnaires
    Given I am a class participant
    And I am logged into the system
    When I access the pending questionnaires page
    Then I should see a list of all unanswered questionnaires from the classes I am enrolled in
    And the option to select a questionnaire to answer

### Success Case
Given I am a class participant
And I am logged into the system
And there are unanswered questionnaires
When I access the pending questionnaires page
Then I should see all the pending questionnaires correctly

### Error Case
Given I am a class participant
And I am logged into the system
And there are no unanswered questionnaires
When I access the pending questionnaires page
Then I should see a message indicating that there are no pending questionnaires

## Scenario: Answer a questionnaire
Given I am a class participant
And I am logged into the system
And I have a pending questionnaire to answer
When I select the questionnaire
And fill in the answers to all the required questions
And click "Submit"
Then the answers should be saved in the system
And the questionnaire should be marked as answered

### Success Case
Given I am a class participant
And I am logged into the system
And I have a pending questionnaire to answer
When I fill in all the answers correctly
And click "Submit"
Then the questionnaire should be successfully saved
And marked as answered

### Error Case
Given I am a class participant
And I am logged into the system
And I have a pending questionnaire to answer
When I leave any required question blank
And click "Submit"
Then I should receive an error message indicating that all required questions must be filled out